## **6. Final Python EDA conclusion**

The exploratory data analysis identified Technology as the strongest category in terms of sales and profitability. The West region generated the highest sales and profit. Furniture generated considerably less profit than the other categories, suggesting an opportunity for further investigation into its pricing, discounting and product costs. The analysis also identified a negative relationship between discounts and profit. These findings can help guide further investigation and support business decisions through the Power BI dashboard.


